### UI

# Shown when examining the shield. Each entry represents the shield's health condition
comp-shield-damaged-1 = It looks fully intact.
comp-shield-damaged-2 = It is lightly damaged.
comp-shield-damaged-3 = [color=yellow]It is moderately damaged, but should hold up a bit longer.[/color]
comp-shield-damaged-4 = [color=orange]It is heavily damaged, and probably won't last too much longer.[/color]
comp-shield-damaged-5 = [color=red]It is severely damaged and on the verge of breaking![/color]
